 "scratch": "原题是计算第三角，现改为判断题。设定两个内角为55°和65°，声称第三个角是70°。验证：180-55-65=60°，60≠70，故为错。难度适中，考查内角和定理及减法运算。",
 "solver_code": "from decimal import Decimal\ndef solve():\n    # 计算真实的第三个角\n    angle1 = Decimal('55')\n    angle2 = Decimal('65')\n    claimed_angle3 = Decimal('70')\n    real_angle3 = Decimal('180') - angle1 - angle2\n    # 判断是否相等\n    return [real_angle3 == claimed_angle3]",
 "figure": null,
